flowchart LR
  accTitle: Feedback review flow
  accDescr: A person records feedback. The team reviews it, then addresses it or keeps it for later. Addressed feedback is marked resolved.
  capture[Record feedback] --> review{Review feedback}
  review -->|Act now| action[Address feedback]
  review -->|Later| backlog[Keep for review]
  backlog --> review
  action --> resolved[Mark resolved]
